The '''Jellyfish Pet''' is an {{skill|alchemy}} Pet that can be obtained from the [[Dark Auction]]. Similar to all other Dark Auction pets, there are only two rarities of this pet, {{Epic}} and {{Legendary}}. It is geared toward the [[Healer]] class for [[Dungeons]], because of its multiple abilities which buff [[healing]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Dark Auction ===
The '''Jellyfish Pet''' has a chance to appear in round 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]] with starting bid of {{c|10000000}}. The {{Epic}} has an overall {{Green|22.706%}} chance to appear, and the {{Legendary}} has a {{Green|6.05%}} chance to appear.

