== Tips ==
* A {{Item|Bubblegum}} is recommended on this pet. It can double the duration of [[Power Orbs]], which is useful in boss fights. When using an {{Item|Overflux Power Orb}} or {{Item|Plasmaflux Power Orb}}, its duration can be extended to {{Green|2 minutes}}. <!--
* This pet is not recommended for use for any class in [[Dungeons]] due the fact that 10 {{StatnameShort|Health}}/s is extremely useless for inside dungeon use, and being doubled by healer still doesn't help. The Enchanted Golden Apple effect is also negligible as an Enchanted Golden Apple is a vanilla item. Potions are also often never used. The only beneficial thing is it can place down Power Orbs using only 25% of max mana without [[Mana Disintegrator|Mana Disintegrators]] and levelling it to Level 100, which isn't worth using about 20 million coins.-->

